thor><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE30%E9%98%B3%E6%98%8E%E8%84%89%E8%A7%A3%E7%AF%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%8D%81/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE/">素问</category><description>黄帝与岐伯探讨足阳明胃经病变的典型症状（畏人畏火、闻木惊惕、登高而歌、弃衣奔走等），阐释其&amp;quot;胃属土畏木&amp;quot;&amp;ldquo;阳盛热极&amp;quot;的病理机制，揭示阳明经气过盛导致精神狂躁的内在关联。</description></item></channel></rss>